These credits cover the maintained project and the changes in this fork.
Original author/copyright notices, the GPL-2.0 LICENSE, and third-party notices
remain intact. Discord's SDK and Apple's artwork retain their separate credits
and terms. Generated icon provenance and its original generation prompt remain
documented in assets/README.md and assets/ipresence-icon-prompt.txt.

Binary artwork and formats without an appropriate author/comment field use
this central AUTHORS file and assets/README.md for attribution. Unmodified
upstream files retain their existing credits.
